{"id": "unknown-2026-07-25-007", "date": "2026-07-25", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "10% US Section 301 tariff opens opportunities for India: FIEO", "content": "FIEO says the additional 10 per cent US Section 301 tariff will raise landed costs for Indian goods but should be read against competitor tariff levels.\nIndia is in the lower tariff category, while several rivals face 12.5 per cent.\nExporters in textiles, garments, leather and footwear are advised to assess duties and exclusions product-wise.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/10-us-section-301-tariff-opens-opportunities-for-india-fieo-312069-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
